WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Field Ecologist: sample a simulated meadow, then see how close your estimate was

2
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:11.006
Dawn at the meadow: a short captioned arrival, skippable from the first frame

3
00:00:11.006 --> 00:00:13.007
Skip any cinematic (Esc)

4
00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:18.008
Module 2: learn to tell the species apart before you count them

5
00:00:18.008 --> 00:00:23.510
Module 3: choose a sampling design. Each one is described honestly, including the biased one

6
00:00:23.510 --> 00:00:32.012
Walk to each quadrat, then tap each plant and name its species to count it

7
00:00:32.012 --> 00:00:35.513
Ten quadrats later, submit your data sheet

8
00:00:35.513 --> 00:00:42.514
Module 4: the reveal. Every plant of your species, against your estimate

9
00:00:42.514 --> 00:00:48.516
Run 1,000 virtual samples to see how each design behaves

10
00:00:48.516 --> 00:00:53.523
Every decision also works in text mode, with data tables and CSV export

11
00:00:53.524 --> 00:00:57.528
The meadow is a simulation, labeled as one. Play free at immersive-learning-showcase.vercel.app
